{"file":"redis-development-1.4.0-v1.zip","bytes":161823,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"redis-development","description":"Redis development best practices — data structures, query engine, vector search, caching, and performance optimization","version":"1.4.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/redis/agent-skills","homepage":"https://redis.io","keywords":["redis","database","caching","vector-search","performance","best-practices"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"redis-development","description":"Redis development best practices for data modeling, search, caching, connections, clustering, security, observability, and agent memory","version":"1.4.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/redis/agent-skills","homepage":"https://redis.io","keywords":["redis","database","caching","vector-search","performance","best-practices"]},{"path":".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","name":"redis-development","description":"Redis development best practices — data structures, query engine, vector search, caching, and performance optimization","version":"1.4.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/redis/agent-skills","homepage":"https://redis.io","keywords":["redis","database","caching","vector-search","performance","best-practices"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/iris-development/SKILL.md","name":"iris-development","description":"Iris is Redis's umbrella for AI-focused products. Use this skill when integrating with the Iris Redis Agent Memory (RAM) data plane on Redis Cloud — recording session events for an AI agent, creating or searching long-term memories, configuring a memory store, or tuning background memory promotion. Code examples use the official `redis-agent-memory` (Python) and `@redis-iris/agent-memory` (TypeScript) SDKs.","headings":["Iris: Redis Agent Memory","Official SDKs","When to Apply","Rule Categories by Priority","Quick Reference","1. Setup & Cloud Service (HIGH)","2. Session Memory / Events (HIGH)","3. Long-Term Memory (HIGH)","4. Memory Promotion (MEDIUM)","How to Use"],"name_hint":"iris · development","description_zh":"通过官方Python或TypeScript SDK接入Redis Cloud的Iris Agent Memory数据面，记录代理会话事件、创建搜索长期记忆、配置记忆存储和后台提升。"},{"path":"skills/redis-clustering/SKILL.md","name":"redis-clustering","description":"Redis Cluster and replication guidance covering hash tags for multi-key operations, avoiding CROSSSLOT errors, and reading from replicas to scale read-heavy workloads. Use when designing keys for a sharded Redis Cluster, debugging CROSSSLOT errors on MGET / SDIFF / pipelines, configuring a multi-key transaction in a cluster, or routing reads to replicas for caches, analytics, or dashboards.","headings":["Redis Clustering","When to apply","1. Hash tags for multi-key operations","Same slot — multi-key ops work","Different keys, no hash tag — CROSSSLOT on multi-key commands in cluster mode","2. Read replicas for read-heavy workloads","Redis Cluster: enable replica reads on the client","References"],"name_hint":"redis · clustering","description_zh":"指导Redis Cluster和复制架构，使用hash tag支持多键操作，排查MGET、SDIFF、流水线及事务的CROSSSLOT，并将读请求路由到副本扩展吞吐。"},{"path":"skills/redis-connections/SKILL.md","name":"redis-connections","description":"Redis client and connection guidance covering connection pooling, multiplexing, pipelining, client-side caching with RESP3, avoiding slow commands (KEYS, SMEMBERS, HGETALL), and tuning socket timeouts. Use when configuring a Redis client (redis-py, Jedis, Lettuce, NRedisStack), batching commands for throughput, eliminating per-request connection creation, iterating large keyspaces with SCAN, enabling client-side caching for read-heavy workloads, or setting connect and read timeouts.","headings":["Redis Connections","When to apply","1. Pool or multiplex — never one connection per request","redis-py — connection pool","2. Pipeline bulk work","3. Avoid commands that scan everything","4. Client-side caching for hot keys","5. Set explicit timeouts","References"],"name_hint":"redis · 连接","description_zh":"配置Redis客户端连接池、多路复用、流水线和RESP3客户端缓存，避免每请求建连接及慢命令，使用SCAN遍历大键空间并调整连接读取超时。"},{"path":"skills/redis-core/SKILL.md","name":"redis-core","description":"Core Redis modeling guidance — choose the right data structure (String, Hash, List, Set, Sorted Set, JSON, Stream, Vector Set) and use consistent colon-separated key names. Use when designing a Redis data model, caching objects, deciding between Hash and JSON, building counters, leaderboards, membership sets, or session stores, or when reviewing/cleaning up Redis key naming.","headings":["Redis Core","When to apply","1. Choose the right data structure","2. Use consistent key names","References"],"name_hint":"redis · core","description_zh":"为Redis模型选择String、Hash、List、Set、Sorted Set、JSON、Stream或Vector Set，并规范冒号分隔键名，适用于缓存、计数器、排行榜、成员及会话。"},{"path":"skills/redis-observability/SKILL.md","name":"redis-observability","description":"Redis observability guidance — which metrics to monitor (memory, connections, hit ratio, ops/sec, rejected connections), which built-in commands to reach for during incident triage (SLOWLOG, INFO, MEMORY DOCTOR, CLIENT LIST, FT.PROFILE), and when to use the Redis Insight GUI. Use when setting up monitoring or alerts for a Redis instance, diagnosing a performance regression, profiling a slow FT.SEARCH query, or wiring Redis metrics into Prometheus, Datadog, or similar.","headings":["Redis Observability","When to apply","1. Monitor these metrics","2. Built-in commands for debugging","3. Redis Insight","References"],"name_hint":"redis · observability","description_zh":"选择Redis内存、连接、命中率、吞吐及拒连监测指标，使用SLOWLOG、INFO、MEMORY DOCTOR、CLIENT LIST、FT.PROFILE或Insight排障，并接入监控告警平台。"},{"path":"skills/redis-search/SKILL.md","name":"redis-search","description":"Redis Search guidance covering FT.CREATE schema design, field type selection (TEXT, TAG, NUMERIC, GEO, GEOSHAPE, VECTOR, JSON path), DIALECT 2 query syntax, FT.SEARCH / FT.AGGREGATE / FT.HYBRID command selection, vector similarity with HNSW or FLAT, hybrid retrieval combining lexical and vector ranking, RAG pipelines, zero-downtime index updates via aliases, and debugging with FT.PROFILE and FT.EXPLAIN. Use when defining a search index on Hash or JSON documents, writing FT.SEARCH queries with filters, sorting, aggregation, or vector KNN, tuning HNSW parameters, building a RAG retrieval pipeline, or troubleshooting slow or empty search results.","headings":["Redis Search","When to apply","1. Pick the right command","FT.SEARCH — most common","FT.AGGREGATE — top categories by avg price","FT.HYBRID (Redis ≥ 8.4) — lexical + vector fusion","2. Schema basics — `FT.CREATE`","3. Common queries","Tag filter + numeric range, sorted by price","Text + tag filter","Negation and OR","4. Vector basics","Index","Pure KNN query (top 5 by cosine similarity)","5. Hybrid retrieval","6. Aggregations and shaping","Top 5 categories by total revenue","7. RAG pattern"],"name_hint":"redis · 搜索","description_zh":"设计Redis Search模式和字段、DIALECT 2查询、过滤排序聚合及向量KNN，选择FT.SEARCH/AGGREGATE/HYBRID、HNSW或FLAT，构建混合RAG检索并以别名更新索引，使用PROFILE/EXPLAIN排查慢或空结果。"},{"path":"skills/redis-security/SKILL.md","name":"redis-security","description":"Redis security guidance covering authentication (requirepass and ACL users), TLS, ACL-based least-privilege access control, restricting network exposure via bind and protected-mode, firewall rules, and disabling dangerous commands. Use when deploying Redis to production, defining ACL users for an application, configuring TLS connections, locking down a Redis instance behind a firewall, or auditing a Redis deployment for security hardening.","headings":["Redis Security","When to apply","1. Always authenticate (and use TLS)","redis.conf","2. ACLs for least-privilege access","Cache-only reader","Writer that can't run dangerous ops","Admin (use sparingly, never for application traffic)","3. Restrict network access","redis.conf — bind to specific interfaces, keep protected-mode on","Firewall — allow only application subnets","References"],"name_hint":"redis · 安全","description_zh":"加固Redis认证、TLS、ACL最小权限、bind和protected-mode网络暴露、防火墙及危险命令，适用于生产部署和安全审查。"},{"path":"skills/redis-semantic-cache/SKILL.md","name":"redis-semantic-cache","description":"Redis LangCache guidance for semantic caching of LLM responses on Redis Cloud — calling search/set via the SDK or REST API, tuning the similarity threshold, separating caches per task type, and filtering with custom attributes. Use when caching LLM completions or RAG answers to cut API cost and latency, building a cache-aside layer in front of OpenAI / Anthropic / etc., tuning hit rate vs precision, or splitting one app's LLM workloads into multiple LangCache caches.","headings":["Redis Semantic Cache","When to apply","1. The cache-aside flow","2. Tune the similarity threshold","Stricter — fewer false positives","Looser — higher hit rate","3. Separate caches per task type","References"],"name_hint":"redis · semantic · cache","description_zh":"用Redis Cloud LangCache缓存LLM或RAG响应，通过SDK或REST查询写入，调整相似阈值、按任务分缓存及属性过滤，以平衡成本、延迟、命中率和精确性。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json","assets/redis-logo.png","skills/iris-development/SKILL.md","skills/iris-development/references/ltm-bulk-create.md","skills/iris-development/references/ltm-organize.md","skills/iris-development/references/ltm-search.md","skills/iris-development/references/promotion-overview.md","skills/iris-development/references/session-add-event.md","skills/iris-development/references/session-retrieval.md","skills/iris-development/references/session-when-to-use.md","skills/iris-development/references/setup-auth-token.md","skills/iris-development/references/setup-cloud-service.md","skills/redis-clustering/SKILL.md","skills/redis-clustering/references/hash-tags.md","skills/redis-clustering/references/read-replicas.md","skills/redis-connections/SKILL.md","sk